{
  "slug": "origami-ms",
  "name": "Origami Ms",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Claude to Origami.ms — query records, create and update data, manage entities, run workflows, and build complete Origami environments through natural language. Includes 14 API tools and 3 expert skills for building, troubleshooting, and integrating with Origami.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `origami-api` (Use this skill when the user asks about the Origami API, wants to \"integrate with Origami\", \"connect to…), `origami-builder` (Use this skill when the user wants to \"build an Origami environment\", \"design a data model in Origami\",…), `origami-support` (Use this skill for any Origami support question: troubleshooting (workflows not firing, imports failing, fields missing, formulas broken,…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `origami-ms`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install origami-ms@claude-community` from `yaniv-ctrl/origami-ms-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
